      "content": "Execution context:\n- Background: implement the missing CLI orchestration for stale active session cleanup so candidate/metadata helpers are reachable from users.\n- Scope: add `kspec session stale close` command with targeting validation (<session-id> vs --refs vs --all), criteria flags, dry-run/apply modes, confirmation behavior, and JSON/human summaries including per-session reasons/totals.\n- Files: src/cli/commands/session/commands.ts, new src/cli/commands/session/stale-close.ts, and new CLI tests for stale close behavior/AC coverage.\n- Verification: targeted stale-close tests, full npm test, and kspec validate before submit.",
