    {
      "_ulid": "01KJKZBJTKCBCRCEWGEH8B06P5",
      "created_at": "2026-03-01T05:53:49.395Z",
      "author": "Jacob Chapel",
      "content": "Implemented `kspec session stale close` end-to-end CLI orchestration for @session-stale-cleanup. Added new `session stale` command group + `close` subcommand with target-mode validation (`<session-id>` vs `--refs` vs `--all`), stale criteria parsing (`--older-than`, `--inactive-for`, `--liveness-guard`), dry-run/apply behavior, confirmation gating (`--force`, non-interactive/JSON handling), per-session reason reporting, and aggregate totals (`candidates`, `changed_sessions`, `skipped_sessions`, `failures`). Command reuses `selectStaleActiveSessions` + `applyAutoAbandonMetadata` and sets a command-specific shadow commit message for applied closures. Added CLI coverage in `tests/session-stale-close.test.ts` for own ACs (`ac-1`..`ac-9`) plus refs batch/error/confirmation traits.\n\nVerification:\n- `npm run build`\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-close.test.ts` (11 passed)\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/session-stale-close.test.ts` (24 passed)\n- `npm test` (baseline failure: existing timeouts in `tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts` lines 34 and 104)\n- `kspec validate` (reports pre-existing project-wide schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task)",
      "supersedes": null,
      "superseded": false
    },
    {
      "_ulid": "01KJKZD34PP8NEG0KYCW8YD95M",
      "created_at": "2026-03-01T05:54:38.871Z",
      "author": "Jacob Chapel",
      "content": "Submitted for review in PR #621: https://github.com/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pull/621 (branch feat/session-stale-close-command, commit b57152010). Implemented `kspec session stale close` orchestration with target-mode validation (`<session-id>`/`--refs`/`--all`), stale criteria flags, dry-run/apply behavior, confirmation gating, per-session reason reporting, and totals output. Added CLI coverage in tests/session-stale-close.test.ts for @session-stale-cleanup ACs and batch/confirmation traits.\n\nVerification:\n- `npm run build`\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\n- `npm test` (pre-existing timeouts in tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts lines 34 and 104)\n- `kspec validate` (pre-existing project-wide schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task)",
