      "content": "[FIX_CYCLE: 2] Addressed blocking review findings for @session-stale-cleanup by completing missing inherited trait AC coverage and guidance behavior.\n\nChanges:\n- Added missing AC annotations/tests in tests/session-stale-close.test.ts for:\n  - @trait-dry-run ac-4\n  - @trait-json-output ac-3\n  - @trait-error-guidance ac-3/ac-5 (with ac-4 marked N/A + reason)\n  - @trait-multi-ref-batch ac-1/ac-3/ac-5\n- Added JSON error-mode coverage to verify structured `error` payloads.\n- Added validation-error coverage to assert field/value detail reporting.\n- Updated stale-close command resolution error messages to include actionable recovery guidance (`kspec session list --status active`) for missing/ambiguous refs.\n\nVerification:\n- `npm run build`\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\n- `npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/session-stale-close.test.ts`\n- `npm test` (baseline failure remains in tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts timeouts at lines 34 and 104)\n- `kspec validate` (pre-existing project-wide schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task)",
